	"Probe the snow [Space]: its depth decides which shelter you can build.": "按住 [Space] 探雪：雪有多深，决定你能建哪种庇护所。",
	"Hold [Space] to probe the snow on leeward slopes. Its depth decides which shelter you can build.": "按住 [Space] 在背风坡探雪。雪有多深，决定你能建哪种庇护所。",
	"Deepest so far %.2f m — too thin to dig. Probe elsewhere, or build a lean-to by a root plate [B].": "目前最深 %.2f m——太薄，挖不了。换个地方探，或者靠树根搭倒棚 [B]。",
	"Deepest so far %.1f m — enough for a trench [B]. A snow cave needs %.1f m.": "目前最深 %.1f m——够挖雪沟 [B]。挖雪洞要 %.1f m。",
	"Deepest so far %.1f m — a snow cave fits [B]. A raised cave needs %.1f m.": "目前最深 %.1f m——能挖雪洞 [B]。高床雪洞要 %.1f m。",
	"Deep snow found (%.1f m) — room for a raised cave. Stand next to it and press [B].": "找到深雪（%.1f m）——够挖高床雪洞。站在旁边按 [B]。",
	"An open lean-to can't trap cold air. Pile bedding thick and keep the reflector fire fed all night.": "开放的倒棚留不住冷空气。垫层铺厚，反射火整夜别断。",
	"You had no shelter at all.": "你什么庇护所都没有。",
	"You read the land right.": "你读懂了这片地。",
	"Right choice of shelter — the weakest score above is what to fix.": "庇护所选对了——照上面最低的那一项改。",
	"%s got you through, but %s fits these conditions better.": "%s 撑过去了，但这种条件更适合%s。",
	"%s was the harder road here; %s fits these conditions.": "这里选%s是在走弯路；这种条件适合%s。",
	"Free play: everything is random.": "自由模式：一切随机。",
	"Read the wind, then dig a snow cave on the sheltered side. You have the whole day.": "先读风向，再在背风的一侧挖雪洞。今天你有一整个白天。",
	"Deep snow hides in only a few places. Probe before you dig.": "深雪只藏在少数几个地方。先探，再挖。",
	"A storm is coming. Read the land and decide which shelter it allows.": "暴风雪要来了。读懂这片地，判断它允许你建哪种庇护所。",
	"You've learned the %s — you can use it on any level now.": "你学会了%s——现在任何关卡都能用。",
	"Learned: %s": "学会了：%s",
	"Shelters you know: %s": "你会的庇护所：%s",
	"New here: %s": "本关新增：%s",
	"snow shovel": "雪铲",
	"extra warm layer": "额外保暖层",
	"NO extra layer": "没有额外保暖层",
	"sleeping pad": "防潮垫",
	"%d birch bark": "%d 份桦树皮",
	"%d dry wood": "%d 根干柴",
	"%d bedding": "%d 份垫层",
	"Gear: %s": "装备：%s",
	"Deep snow (up to %.1f m) and a %d km/h wind: dig into the lee slope, entrance away from the wind.": "深雪（最深 %.1f m）、%d km/h 的风：在背风坡挖洞，入口背着风。",
	"Only %d%% of this valley had snow deep enough for a cave (≥ %.1f m), in a few lee pockets. Probing finds them.": "这个山谷只有 %d%% 的地方雪深够挖雪洞（≥ %.1f m），藏在几处背风窝里，靠探测才找得到。",
	"You started at %s with %d min of light; a snow cave takes about %d min to dig. A root plate is half a shelter: a lean-to and a fire go up in time.": "你 %s 开工，只剩 %d 分钟天光；挖一个雪洞要约 %d 分钟。树根盘就是半个庇护所：倒棚和火来得及。",
	"No snow here was deeper than %.1f m; a cave needs %.1f m. A trench works from %.1f m.": "这里最深的雪只有 %.1f m，挖雪洞要 %.1f m；雪沟 %.1f m 就能挖。",
	"Storm night: %d km/h wind and %d °C. The deepest snow was %.1f m, so the shelter it allowed was: %s.": "暴风雪夜：风 %d km/h，%d °C。最深的雪 %.1f m，所以能建的是：%s。",
	"Chapter %d · stage %d — ": "第 %d 章 · 第 %d 阶——",
	"Blowdown: fallen trees everywhere and little light left. A root plate is half a shelter: build a lean-to and keep a fire going.": "风倒区：到处是倒木，天光不多了。树根盘就是半个庇护所：搭倒棚，把火烧旺。",
	"Open, flat ground and shallow snow: no drift deep enough for a cave. Dig a trench.": "开阔平地、雪不深：没有够挖雪洞的雪堆。挖雪沟。",
	"COLD or SAFE on stage %d opens stage %d.": "第 %d 阶拿到 COLD 或 SAFE 开放第 %d 阶。",
	"Pass stage %d to open chapter %d.": "通过第 %d 阶开放第 %d 章。",
	"Free play": "自由模式",
	"Chapter %d · Stage %d  (%d of 50)": "第 %d 章 · 第 %d 阶（共 50 阶中的第 %d 阶）",
	"Stage %d unlocked!": "第 %d 阶已开放！",
	"Chapter %d unlocked!": "第 %d 章已开放！",
	"[Enter] next stage   ·   [R] same place again": "[Enter] 下一阶   ·   [R] 同一个地方再来",
	"Reach COLD or SAFE to unlock the next stage.  [R] try the same place again": "拿到 COLD 或 SAFE 才能开放下一阶。  [R] 同一个地方再试一次",
	"Best on this stage: %s (%s)": "本阶最好：%s（%s）",
	"[←] CHAPTER [→]": "[←] 章 [→]",
	"[↓] STAGE [↑]": "[↓] 阶 [↑]",
	"Map %d  [N] new map   ·   Seed %d": "第 %d 张图  [N] 换一张   ·   种子 %d",
	"You have about an hour of light to read the land, gather what you need and build a shelter for the night.\n\n": "你大约只有 1 个小时的天光：读懂这片地、收集所需，在天黑前建好过夜的庇护所。\n\n",
	"Digging soaks your layers. Dry them by a fire before you crawl in — wet clothes hold almost no heat.": "挖雪会弄湿保暖层。钻进去之前先在火边烘干——湿衣服几乎不保暖。",
	"Right shelter, but you never probed where you dug — the depth was luck. Probe before you dig.": "庇护所选对了，但你从没在挖的地方探过雪——深度是碰巧的。先探，再挖。",
	"Right shelter, but the entrance was only %d° away from the wind — face it fully downwind (120°+).": "庇护所选对了，但入口只偏离风向 %d°——让它完全背风（120° 以上）。",
	"Your %s": "你的%s",
	"Entrance here · [N] rest when ready": "入口在这里 · 准备好就 [N] 休息",
	"Tree well": "树井",
	"Tree Well Shelter": "树井庇护所",
	"1. Scoop out the well around the trunk": "1. 掏出树干周围的雪坑",
	"2. Trim low inner branches (headroom)": "2. 修掉里面的低枝（留出空间）",
	"3. Spruce-bough floor": "3. 云杉枝地板",
	"4. Thatch the gaps in the bough roof": "4. 用枝条补好屋顶的空隙",
	"5. Close the entrance with boughs": "5. 用枝条封住入口",
	"Snow around this spruce is too shallow for a tree well (%.2f m < %.2f m)": "这棵云杉周围的雪太浅，做不了树井（%.2f m < %.2f m）",
	"Too steep around this trunk for a tree well": "这棵树周围太陡，做不了树井",
	"No big spruce with low branches here — look for one: the snow around its trunk is shallow.": "这里没有低枝浓密的大云杉——去找一棵：它树干周围的雪很浅。",
	"No shovel today, but the forest gives you a roof. Find a big spruce with low branches: the snow around its trunk is shallow. Dig a tree well.": "今天没有雪铲，但森林会给你屋顶。找一棵低枝浓密的大云杉：它树干周围的雪很浅。挖一个树井。",
	"No shovel: a snow cave dug by hand takes about %d min; a tree well under a big spruce took about %d. The old spruces with a hollow at their base were the shelter.": "没有雪铲：徒手挖雪洞要约 %d 分钟；大云杉下的树井只要约 %d 分钟。树根处有浅坑的老云杉，就是现成的庇护所。",
	"You're in it · [N] rest when ready": "你就在里面 · 准备好就 [N] 休息",
	"Your layers are wet and no longer warm — dry them by a fire [F]: right behind a root plate on its downwind side, away from spruce branches.": "保暖层湿透了，不再保暖——去火边烘干 [F]：紧贴树根盘的下风一侧生火，别在云杉树枝下面。",
	"The wind blew the flame out. Go right behind a root plate on its downwind side, or into a leeward hollow. Your finished walls shelter the downwind side too.": "风把火苗吹灭了。去树根盘紧贴下风的一侧，或者找个背风的凹处。你建好的墙，下风一侧也能挡风。",
	"Sheltered fire spot": "避风的生火处",
	"Out of the wind, no branches above · [F] here": "挡得住风、头上没有树枝 · 在这里按 [F]",
	"To finish the shelter you still need: %s": "要完工还缺：%s",
	"NO shovel — dig with your pot, %dx slower": "没有雪铲——用锅挖雪，慢 %d 倍",
	"NO shovel or pot — dig by hand, %dx slower and wetter": "没有雪铲也没有锅——徒手挖，慢 %d 倍，而且更湿",
	"caribou hides": "驯鹿皮",
	"Hold [Space] to fast-forward": "按住 [Space] 快进",
