	"The roof sags under new snow": "新雪压得屋顶往下塌",
	"Body warmth %d. The cold woke you — do something, or try to sleep on.": "体温 %d。冷把你冻醒了——做点什么，或者接着睡。",
	"Body warmth %d. You will not survive the night lying still. Get up and move, now.": "体温 %d。躺着不动你熬不过今晚。马上起来活动。",
	"Only embers left. Without more wood the cold comes back within the hour.": "只剩余烬了。不添柴，一个小时之内冷就回来。",
	"You went to bed in wet socks. Wet layers hold almost no heat.": "你穿着湿袜子睡下了。湿衣服几乎不保暖。",
