	"You slept through and walked out at dawn. Lowest body warmth %d.": "你一觉睡到天亮，走了出来。夜里体温最低 %d。",
	"You made it to dawn, but it was a hard night: lowest body warmth %d, woke once. Biggest heat leak: %s.": "你熬到了天亮，但这一夜很难熬：体温最低 %d，醒了 1 次。热量漏得最多的是：%s。",
	"You made it to dawn, but it was a hard night: lowest body warmth %d, woke %d times. Biggest heat leak: %s.": "你熬到了天亮，但这一夜很难熬：体温最低 %d，醒了 %d 次。热量漏得最多的是：%s。",
	"The air ran out in a shelter with no vent. You woke with the warning and went back to sleep.": "没有通风口的庇护所里空气耗尽了。你醒来时已经有了警告，却又睡了回去。",
