	"READ THE LAND": "读懂大地",
	"Trees show wind direction — branches are short on the windward side, crowns lean downwind.": "树指示风向——迎风侧枝条短，树冠向下风倾斜。",
	"Snow drifts reveal depth — leeward slopes collect the deepest snow. Probe to be sure.": "积雪形状透露深度——背风坡雪最深。用探针确认。",
	"Standing dead trees mean fuel — fallen logs are wet and won't burn.": "立枯木是燃料——倒木是湿的，烧不着。",
	"Rootballs and thick forest break the wind — shelter there, and light fires there.": "树根盘和密林能挡风——在那里避风、生火。",
	"Shadows tell time — the longer they get, the less daylight you have left.": "影子就是时钟——影子越长，天光越少。",
