	"Cold air sinks. In a snow cave, dig a cold-air pit and sleep on a raised platform.": "冷空气下沉。在雪洞里挖冷气坑，睡在高床上。",
	"Always pierce a vent in a snow shelter. Stale air kills quietly.": "雪庇护所一定要打通风孔。浑浊的空气会悄无声息地致命。",
	"Probe several spots — deeper snow means thicker walls. Warm up by a fire and drink something hot before you crawl in.": "多探几处——雪越深墙越厚。钻进去前先烤火、喝点热的。",
	"An open lean-to can't trap cold air. Pile bedding thick and keep the reflector fire fed — or find deeper snow for a cave.": "开放的倒棚留不住冷空气。垫层铺厚、反射火别断——或者找更深的雪挖洞。",
	"The night is %.0f hours long. At %.0f h per log, a lean-to fire needs about %d logs of dry wood stockpiled.": "夜长 %.0f 小时。每根柴烧 %.0f 小时，倒棚的火需要备约 %d 根干柴。",
	"When snow is falling, leave a stick in the vent and poke it clear — or dig a second vent.": "下雪时在通风孔里插根木棍，夜里捅开——或者再挖一根通风管。",
	"Without any shelter the wind takes your heat all night. Even a half-finished trench is better than nothing.": "没有庇护所，风会整夜带走你的热量。哪怕半成品的雪沟也比什么都没有强。",
	"Survive a night in a shelter and you've learned it — use it on any level after that.": "在某种庇护所里熬过一夜，就算学会了——之后任何关卡都能用。",
	"%s  ·  %d °C  ·  wind from the %s, %d km/h  ·  sunset %s, ~%d h of light": "%s  ·  %d °C  ·  %s风 %d km/h  ·  日落 %s，约 %d 小时天光",
	"A shovel digs at full speed. Digging still makes you sweat — dry off by a fire before bed.": "有雪铲，挖雪是全速。挖雪照样出汗——睡前在火边烘干。",
	"Without a shovel every snow shelter takes much longer — a trench or a tree well may be all the day allows.": "没有雪铲，每种雪庇护所都慢得多——这一天也许只够做雪沟或树井。",
	"All shelters are open in free play.": "自由模式里所有庇护所都可用。",
